      "summary": "Common Ground is a turn-based game in which five households share one lake for twenty seasons, and the lake regrows only as much as the households leave in it. Each season, players decide how many fish to take and whether to rest, share with the household most in need, watch what the others take, or propose a limit for everyone to follow. It is about how a shared resource can hold up when neighbours can see one another's choices and keep their promises.",
      "rank": null
